  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_7e6e939d-955a-4560-add0-b46a31a1e865.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_af2a64af-1930-4b6d-ab80-a60736ce8adf.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_6e02649d-5999-4f25-8e03-338958e3fb7c.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_a9587c26-f702-408a-8c48-e91dda063bfb.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_4fa38b48-e394-4632-b818-3cf2289082ef.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>📓 <strong>自定义角色选择<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/otherworld-origins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">种族与职业系统</a>（角色卡），包含戏法和专长</strong></p><p><strong>🎖️ RPG等级制敌人，带有<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/otherworld-apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传奇装备</a>战利品，以及为幽暗地域子种族和建筑者提供的重铸系统</strong></p><p><strong>📈 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/justleveling-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">角色成长与升级</a>，通过游戏玩法解锁能力和属性</strong></p><p><strong>⛰️ 庞大的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tectonic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻想世界生成</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻想生物群系</a></strong></p><p><strong>🏘️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lukis-grand-capitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">首都城市</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">增强型村庄</a></strong></p><p><strong>🧝🏻 幻想居民，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-orcs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">兽人</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goblins-tyranny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">哥布林</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">龙</a></strong></p><p><strong>🪙 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/numismatic-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">货币系统</a>，包含金币和银币，以及<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村庄悬赏</a></strong></p><p><strong>🔧 大量专属补丁，将所有内容融合为一个统一、平衡的RPG系统</strong></p><p><strong>⚔️ 沉浸式战役将所有内容串联起来，包含新维度、结构变化、仪式和故事线+背景设定！</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1418133/description_c533b39e-d824-40b7-9e28-6370d16881d0.png\" alt=\"image\"><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/LunaPixel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0Qp_lkAVsvU\" width=\"800\" height=\"448\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eojLV6R_QpY\" width=\"800\" height=\"448\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></a></em></p><p><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/LunaPixel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_d840ee50-ebee-4996-8a0e-fbb68893f85c.png\" alt=\"\"></a> 俄语翻译附加组件（社区制作，未经核实，机器翻译）<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/otherworld-dnd-rus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点此前往！</a></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
